### Description
1、I run the code-server in a docker container, and the coder-server listen the container port 20000
2、the docker contianer map the port 20000 to the host port 62400
3、There is a nginx bind to 20015 ,
4、In the web Browser, url is https://host-ip:20015/62400/ , I can access code-server
5、when I changing the  code-server IDE theme, it dose not take any effect


#### nginx configuration

```
worker_processes  1;
events {
    worker_connections  1024;
}


http {
    include       mime.types;
    default_type  application/octet-stream;
    sendfile        on;
    keepalive_timeout  65;

    server {
        listen       20015;
        server_name  localhost;
        location ~ ^/(\d+)/(.*) {
            proxy_set_header Host $http_host;
            proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;

            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
            proxy_connect_timeout 300;
            proxy_http_version 1.1;

            proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
            proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
            proxy_pass http://0.0.0.0:$1/$2;
        }
    }

}
```

