Hi,
It looks like you sent an invalid request.
Is port 443 in the URL [https://host-ip:443/40000/](https://host-ip/40000/) bound to nginx?

If yes, you can check if you sent a valid request by using this minimal configuration:
```
    location ~ ^/(\d+)/(.*) {
        return 200 $1;
    }
```
